# Op-amp driving an emitter follower, feedback taken from the emitter so the
# transistor sits inside the loop. This is the headphone amp's output stage
# reduced to one channel, and reproduces the Q4 tangle: the emitter node has
# four pins on it and each one is currently routed as its own wire.
net IN
net OUT
net GND
net 5V
net 12V
net -12V
part 1k:Rin
part 47k:Rf
part 340R:Rpull
part 33R:Rs
part TL074:U1A
part BC849C:Q1
IN -> Rin@1
Rin@2 -> U1A@2
U1A@3 -> GND
U1A@4 -> 12V
U1A@11 -> -12V
U1A@1 -> Q1@1
Q1@3 -> 5V
Q1@2 -> Rf@1
Rf@2 -> U1A@2
Q1@2 -> Rpull@1
Rpull@2 -> -12V
Q1@2 -> Rs@1
Rs@2 -> OUT
